    "description": "YLDS is a permissioned, yield-bearing USD-denominated digital instrument issued by Figure Certificate Company (FCC) on the Provenance Blockchain. FCC's S-1/prospectus provides audited financial statements, and YLDS reserve and excess balances are reconciled and published daily on ylds.com with quarterly audits reported in issuer filings. YLDS is redeemable 24/7/365, with withdrawal timing subject to the operating hours and settlement constraints of underlying fiat payment rails and blockchain networks. YLDS can be held in self-custody via a Provenance Blockchain wallet and transferred peer-to-peer to other KYC/KYB-approved Provenance addresses, within the Figure Markets self-custody exchange experience, YLDS can be used to settle trades or lent out.",
